[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/12306923708257855021/CFD03A6CF4DC5104DF8E1455C5C83D243382BC20/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]

[h1]本地化 / Localization[/h1]
简中 / English / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español
[i]九种语言均已有源文本；法、德、日、韩、波、俄、西译文由 MiniMax-M3 辅助生成并经过结构/占位符审阅，但九语言母语级术语、人格和游戏内截断签核仍待完成。All nine languages now have source text. French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, and Spanish were translated with MiniMax-M3 assistance and structurally reviewed, but native-level terminology/persona and in-game truncation sign-off remain pending.[/i]

[i]单机定位。/ Single-player oriented.[/i]

[h1]版本与兼容性 / Version & Compatibility[/h1]
既有实测基线为 CK3 1.19.0.6；上述候选廷臣尚未验收。推荐新开局与单机。无继承人结算使用生成的原生继承窗投影，其他同样覆盖 window_succession_event.gui 的 mod 会冲突；未逐项验证的 on_action、GUI 或同键资源组合也不作兼容保证。
The existing tested baseline is CK3 1.19.0.6; the candidate courtier above is not yet validated. New single-player games are recommended. The no-heir settlement uses a generated projection of the native succession window and conflicts with other mods replacing window_succession_event.gui; other untested on_action, GUI, or same-key combinations are not guaranteed.

[h1]一局有多长 / Run Length[/h1]
一局等于签约统治者的一生。30–50 年通常包含约 10–17 次垂青会，每次最多两个模态窗口。
One run is the contracted ruler's lifetime. A 30–50 year life usually sees about 10–17 favor sessions, at no more than two modal windows each.

[h1]FAQ[/h1]
[b]死亡后能继续继承人吗？[/b] 不能；有继承人时确认结算后进入观察者模式，无继承人时退出主菜单。
[b]Can I continue as the heir?[/b] No; settlement enters observer mode when an heir exists, or exits to the main menu when none exists.
[b]关闭教程？ / Tutorials disabled?[/b] 旧纪录可读，新纪录与契约 PB 不会落盘。Existing data is readable, but new records and contract PBs will not persist.

